  - **Minimal fix:** Change loop condition from 'i < stops.length - 1' to 'i < stops.length' on line 6 to include all stops; the existing join(' -> ') separator already handles multiple elements correctly
- **test/schedule.test.ts** (`formatStops`): Tests verify first stop but lack assertion for final stop, allowing the omission to go undetected  (verify only — no edit expected here)
  - **Minimal fix:** Add assertion to formatStops test suite to verify final stop name 'Eglinton' appears in output (reuse existing expect/toContain pattern from line 12)

